\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Magnetic flux paths in the proposed integrated transformer across the six operating modes. (a) Mode 1 ($t_1 < t < t_2$): Phase 1 is charging and Phase 2 is discharging, resulting in the coexistence of $B'$ and $B''$. (b) Modes 2 and 3 ($t_2 < t < t_4$): Phase 1 is solely active, demonstrating perfect flux cancellation in the center leg. (c) Mode 4 ($t_4 < t < t_5$): Phase 2 is charging and Phase 1 is discharging, with both $B'$ and $B''$ present. (d) Modes 5 and 6 ($t_5 < t < t_7$): Phase 2 is solely active.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
